  "verseCount": 47,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "48",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 48"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "48",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "DaMowabi. Yehova wamazaza, Nzambi yaIsarela, nahoshi nindi, Yayo Nebo! Anamubalumuni dehi kwachihembi. Kiriyatayimi anamutiyishi dehi nsonyi, anamutambuli dehi. Misiŋabi anamutiyishi dehi nsonyi, anamuhumoni dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikudi nawa kushimeka Mowabuku. Anamukasili dehi yatama muHeshiboni, nawu, Tuyenu twakamufumishuhu abuli kwikala muza. Eyi Madimeni nineyi nawa akakumwenesha; mpoku yakabali yakakuhaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KuHoranayimi kunatiyakani nyiteti, hiyakuyipupa, hiyakuyijilumuna nankashi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mowabi anamujilumuni dehi, kudi anyanindi kunatiyakani nyiteti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adi nakukandukila kumukandu wakuLuhiti namunzenzcnzi wakudila. Muloŋa kumukandu wakukunkumukila kuHoranayimi anatiyuku kukala kwanyiteti yakujilumuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temukenu mudihandishi mwikali neyi kamusasachi kamwisaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa eyi wakakwachikila muloŋa wakukuhwelela nyidimu yeyeyi aweni, niyuma yeyeyi aweni yalema; Kemoshi wakaya muwukoli, niatupristu twindi niatulamba twindi hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakubuwa akenza hanyikala yejima, kwosi mukala niwumu wakapulukaku. Nichinekineki nawa chakakisika, nichana akachikisaŋana mwomwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwinkenu Mowabi mpuula kulonda amoni jakutúuka ayi; nyikala yindi yakabalumuka yihembi yakadi antu akushakamamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukukoŋa mudimu waYehova namaleŋu, ekali washigewa, wukulekesha mpoku yindi yakabali kumashi, ekali washigewa nawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mowabi kufumisha kuwansi windi nashakami kwindi mumesu mwawunda be-te-te-e neyi walwa wunateeli hanchiba jawu, kumuhuŋununa afuma nswaha yimu aya nswaha yikwawu nehi, hela kuya muwukoli nehi. Dichi wuchidi nalumweŋumweŋu lwindi, niivumba dindi kubalumuka nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova nindi, Tiyenu, kwakenza mafuku inakatemesha antu akamutegeleka kulonda amumwaŋamwaŋi, akamanisha yidi munswaha jindi, akafumpa ninsaba jawu pwashi-pwashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mowabi wakatiya Kemoshinsonyi, neyi chatiyiluwu akwamutaŋa waIsarela chikuhwelela chawu Beteli nsonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi enu mudi nakuhosha ŋahi nenu, Tuyayilobu, tuyamayala aŋovu jakwasa njita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mowabi wela dehi kwayihembi, akandukila dehi munyikala yawu, anyikwenzi jawu akutonda chakutonda anakunkumuki dehi kwakuyŋahila. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta wukweti ijina dindiYehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukala kwaMowabi kudi kwakwihi, keŋa kushiki, ikabi dindi hidikunyakala lufuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ejima mudi nindi kwakwihi kwi-ndo, ninenu ejima mweluka ijina dindi, dihuŋishenu kunyitu nansaŋuyindi; ilenu nenu, Nkiinyi yakola O chiyinakotoki, oyi mbwechi yadiŋi Okuwaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana wamumbanda washakama muDiboni, shiyaku kulema kweyi, wukunkumuki, wushakami nampwila; muloŋa mukwakubuwa Mowabi nakuwani dehi, nakisaŋani dehi yipaka yeyi yiwadikaŋila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi washakama muAroweli, imanaku kunjila wutalatali; ihulaku amayala adi nakutemuka, niambanda adi nakupuluka, neyi, Kunasoŋidi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mowabi anamutiyishi nsonyi, nakwati dehi chikasa kukanwa. Kalokenu nyiteti yakudila. Shimunenu muArinoni nenu, Mowabi wela dehi kwayihembi hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusompa kwawana dehi ituŋa dachana; kwawana dehi niHoloni, niYahaza, niMefwayata; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niDiboni, niNebo, niBeti Dibilatayimi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niKiriyata yimi, niBeti Gamuli, niBeti Meyoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niKeriyoti, niBozira, ninyikala yamwituŋa daMowabi yejima, hela yakwakulehi hela yakwakwihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luseŋu lwaMowabi aluketula dehi ngwa, chikasa chindi chinakotoki. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musheteshenu, muloŋa yena waditohesheli chakudikaŋa naYehova. Mowabi wakaalaŋana mumasanjilindi, akamuyiŋila niyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela hiyeyi wadiŋi nakuyiyiŋila ku? Hiyayiweni mukachi kawamakombuku? Chejima chiwayitenaŋa wayilembulaŋa nanamutu weyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwashakama muMowabi, fumenu munyikala, mushakami mwilola; mwikali neyi kambolu katuŋaŋa kasasa kindi mumbavu yawina kuwiŋililu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunatiyi dehi wanta wadinkayi Mowabi, muloŋa yena wasweja kudinka wanta. O chadimujolayi, nikudinka wanta, nikudi-vuna, nikudilemesha mumuchima windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Neluka dehi ndombu yindi, yamukunkulwayi tuhu kwayu. Kudisama kwindi hikwakoŋaŋa chumaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi nukukaloka nyiteti nansaŋu yaMowabi, nukuyibila aMowabi ejima. Nukudishona nansaŋu jawantu amuKiriheresi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi muvinyu wakuSibima nukukudila chakubadika kudila kwaYazeri; nyitayi yeyi yinamotoki kaluŋalwiji, yinashiki nikukaluŋalwiji kakuYazeri. Akwakubuwa anazemukili nyikabu yeyi yahankanza, ninyikabu yeyi yavinyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikutiya kuwaha nikuzaŋajala akufumisha dehi mwiha dasoŋaŋa nyikabu nimwituŋa daMowabi. Kuwukamwinu wavinyu naketwishuku dehi vinyu. Kwosi wakadatola vinyu nakudikuwaku. Kudikuwa hikwakekala nawa kudikuwaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyiteti yakuHeshiboni yinatiyakani nikuEleyale, izu dawu dinashiki nikuYahazi nawa, kufumisha kuZowari nikuHorona yimi nawa, nikuEgilati Shelishiya. Muloŋa kumeji akuNimirimi kuneli dehi kwayihembi hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, MuMowabi nakaketwishamu akwakulambula hayinaŋanaŋa, niakwakwochela akishi awu insensi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi muchima wami wamwimbilaŋa Mowabi neyi nzenzi jakudila, muchima wami wembilaŋa antu akuKiriheresi neyi nzenzi jakudila, muloŋa yuma yayivulu yaheteliyi yinakisiki dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa nyitu yejima kwatuwewa hohu, mawevu ejima akutetateta, hamakasa ejima hakutapola tapola, hankuma hadi yikeleyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamawulu amatala amuMowabi ejima, nimunyikwakwa yekalamu, mudi kwamakumbu hohu kwejima; muloŋa ami namufumpi dehi Mowabi neyi nsaba yabula kukeŋewa. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochiwa humokadehi! Ochadina kukalokawu! Mowabi o chanafutaleliyi nyima nansonyi janatiyiyi! Dichi Mowabi akamuyiŋila, akamukwatila chikasa kukanwa kudi antu ejima adi nindi kwakwihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, wakatúuka neyi mbuulu, wakamutanjikila Mowabi mpuula jindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keriyoti amukwata dehi, mpwembu anajibazumwishi dehi, nyichima yawayilobu amuMowabi denodu ifuku yakekala neyi muchima wamumbanda wudi nanyisoŋu yakuvwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mowabi akamujilumuna, hakekala nawa cheŋi muzaku, nanochu chanaditoheshiyi naYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Eyi washakama muMowabi, niwoma, niikela, nimuhetu yinakuwani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wakatemuka woma Mukena wakakulukila mwikela; muntu wakafuma mwikela wakafwa mumuhetu. Muloŋa nakamuletela, eŋa, nakamuletela Mowabi, mwaka wakuyihempula. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu atemukili anemani chakadi Ŋovu, muwulelu waHeshiboni. Muloŋa kesi kanafumi muHeshiboni, nimuzuzu wakesi wunafumi mukachi kaSihoni, wunalashi iwombu daMowabi nimashina anyitu yawantu aletaŋa mapumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Mowabi yayo! Antu aKemoshi anazaazi. Muloŋa anyaneyi amayala anayitwali muwukoli, nianyaneyi awambanda anayitwali muwukoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 48:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Hela chochu, hamafuku akukuminina namba kafuntisha cheŋi aMowabi ayili muwukoli. Henahanu dihu hanakumini kusompesha aMowabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.48.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.48.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
